# Rust build artifacts
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
# Note: Once Cargo.toml is introduced, decide whether to track Cargo.lock
# (recommended if objrender ships a CLI binary; ignored for pure library crates).

# Criterion benchmark reports (if generated outside /target)
/criterion/

# IDEs and editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS metadata
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Large decoded bitstreams and rendered audio outputs
# Small synthetic/golden test fixtures can be tracked explicitly under tests/fixtures/
*.wav
*.rf64
*.pcm
*.raw
*.caf
*.thd
*.mlp
*.atmos
*.atmos.audio
*.atmos.metadata
!tests/fixtures/**
